# alt_recenter_gate.expect — throttle re-center gate after ALT_HOLD auto-takeoff (Case A)
# ALT_HOLD 自動離陸後のスロットル再センターゲート（Case A）
#
# The decisive contrast: with the throttle held UP (3500) the WHOLE time,
#   D [13.0,15.5]: gate CLOSED → altitude stays ~0.5 m (alt_max < 0.72). Were the gate
#     absent, the 0.355 m/s climb command would carry the craft past 1.5 m by 15.5 s.
#   F [19.5,20.5]: after re-centering at E the gate OPENS, so the SAME up-stick now
#     climbs (alt_mean > 0.85) — proving the stick works once re-centered.
# 決定的な対比: スロットルを終始 UP(3500) のまま、
#   D [13.0,15.5]: ゲート閉 → 高度は ~0.5 m に留まる(alt_max < 0.72)。ゲートが無ければ
#     0.355 m/s の上昇指令で 15.5 s までに 1.5 m を超える。
#   F [19.5,20.5]: E で再センター後ゲートが開き、同じ上げスティックで今度は上昇(alt_mean > 0.85)
#     — 再センター後はスティックが効くことの証明。
exit 0
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
# Gate CLOSED: throttle up is IGNORED — altitude holds the captured 0.5 m, no jump.
metric alt_mean > 0.42 in 13.0 15.5
metric alt_max  < 0.72 in 13.0 15.5
metric alt_band < 0.20 in 13.0 15.5
# Gate OPEN (after re-centering at E): the SAME up-stick now climbs well past 0.5 m.
metric alt_mean > 0.85 in 19.5 20.5
metric tilt_max < 10.0 in 9.0 20.5
metric duty_max < 0.92 in 12.0 20.5
